    <section id="getbuildtrigger-example-command">
      <title>Example command</title>
      <codeblock outputclass="language-terminal">$ curl -X GET "https://quay-server.example.com/api/v1/repository/example_namespace/example_repo/trigger/example-trigger-uuid" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer &lt;your_access_token&gt;"</codeblock>
